<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia</p>
<p>said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS700 million   5.805	 5.79-5.82   5.795</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 14)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.637	 5.61-5.66   5.656</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 30)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.615	 5.61-5.62   5.632 (Jan 15)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 93)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
